 The show is also switching up its formula in Season 4, after moving to Vancouver from Los Angeles . New locations, more attention to the characters' personal lives, and a few unresolved mysteries have given the latest installment a different feel. But Tracker Season 4, Episode 5, “Need to Know,” marks a big change for the series.
