 Russell's Return Could Be a Turning Point for 'Tracker' Season 4
 Image via CBS 
 The team-up comes at an interesting time for Tracker . The show still has plenty of unfinished business with the Shaw family, and Russell is at the center of one of the biggest mysteries involving Colter .
 The Season 3 finale revealed that Russell had made a deal with McIntyre involving a file about what their father, Ashton, did to Colter as a child. Russell left town with that information and asked Reenie to keep his secret.
 Tracker Season 4, Episode 5, “Need to Know,” doesn't resolve anything yet, but it does make Russell's return feel significant. His conversation with Reenie is another highlight. The two have easy, playful banter, make dinner plans, and arrange for Russell to see her new office. They have a comfortable rapport, but that's beside the point. The interaction proves Russell is back in Colter's life, and he's maintaining relationships with the people Colter relies on, too.
